        }
      ],
      "message": "wallettool: Do not load a newly created wallet database\n\nThe create command opened the new, empty database through\nPopulateWalletFromDB before it set the wallet flags and generated the\ndescriptors. There is nothing to load at that point, and it made the\nloading code accept a database without a FLAGS record.\n\nSkip the load when creating, and write the version records in\nWalletCreate as CWallet::CreateNew does, since loading no longer\nwrites them.\n\nSigned-off-by: Jan Kahmen <jan@turingpoint.de>",
      "committer": {
        "name": "Jan Kahmen",
        "email": "36455663+kah-ja@users.noreply.github.com",
        "date": "2026-11-16T06:15:44Z"
      },
